<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-16866] Integer value is out of bounds when the dataregion maxSize is large enough</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16866</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In the Random2LruPageEvictionTracker and RandomLruPageEvictionTracker, trackingSize is int, Therefore, when the maxSize of the dataregion is large enough (for example, more than 1.2T), execute GridUnsafe.allocateMemory to allocate memory, the maximum value of int will be exceeded.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
